}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4311"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f9e307929bbcaccb8cd0acc0fa77a0c1fae4dd667bdfebc9fdf60cda6b30475.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0b500236a3c0defbbabbd87973ab510b117ad6c3a67bfdfd234a13b64c1ce85.webp","width":256,"height":244,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c47136","characterName":"イリアス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c47136"},"originalCharacterName":"イリアス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46db55b9ab57d799e3bb367af2453244abc050695a60c149d3a42f0033232a21.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/793f09cc424189f95659509d09ae5f455ee5ee8f643ba7ae3dd64eea5f9e9c6c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5277","characterName":"シルフ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5277"},"originalCharacterName":"シルフ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the four great spirits, Sylph rules over the wind. Though she's a type of fairy, her magic far surpasses a normal one. Since she is averse to battle, Sylph is unable to properly use her powerful magic in a fight. Even so, she isn't an opponent that a normal adventurer can handle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to her fairy nature, she loves playing tricks on people. Interested by male genitalia, she will use her wind to play with men until they ejaculate. In addition, she absorbs male semen to replenish her magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though she has a physical body, she is able to turn into a spirit body. Using her spirit body, she can possess a man and allow him to use her powers. However, the man needs to be very skilled to manage the enormous magic Sylph holds. For that reason, the spirits will only give their assistance to those they deem worthy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From In-game Monsterpedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5277"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04425967c3e7691d80252ca0a8215853804f85f3a54138c25764e0bdb261ab43.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b0f88995e860e433236666da4183b936ee52a21f5bb2a3d56211a62562448a4.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5278","characterName":"ノーム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5278"},"originalCharacterName":"ノーム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Holding huge magic, the Earth Spirit Gnome can freely manipulate the Earth itself. However, she has very little combat experience, so she doesn’t know how to effectively use her magic in a fight. Gnome usually spends her time in the desert playing with the sand and mud. When she senses a human approaching, she will usually hide and silently observe them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to her curious nature, if Gnome catches a man, she will take her time to play and inspect him. To replenish her magic, she will use her mud dolls to collect semen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"If you defeat Gnome, she will lend you her power. When she possesses you with her spirit body, you can use her Earth magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though it looks like she bullies Sylph, it may just be because she doesn’t know how to express her feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From In-game Monsterpedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5278"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e537a54d33ae638cd72823a73e9d8b76001f9b01ed04f0cb6bf1641dcf59446.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bb21b8dee27dd5479f6034cbf29d6daece8965780243c199ebb214a410a6579.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c53381","characterName":"アリスフィーズ・フェイタルベルン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c53381"},"originalCharacterName":"アリスフィーズ・フェイタルベルン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Current monster lord, Alicefeeze Fatalburn (or simply alice), had her powers sealed by the White Rabbit. The Rabbit's reasons are unknown."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c53381"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62a0b2bc897d7e1119be6bfec2a9ef4034267f417e3912939d9c485c7de128e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/753157786805104842102618372d772bfe91e28e85b4478f93595b6cf00945a6.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c62435","characterName":"ルシフィナちゃん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c62435"},"originalCharacterName":"ルシフィナちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status"